<!--
     Mantra Manual Camera, v88: a camera body and its lens, the same drawing as
     the SNAP key. MANTRA_MANIFEST modules/app-icon.md: everything inside the
     42 box (33 … 75), so the symbol is 42 / 72 = 0.58 of the visible circle.
-->
